%% Auditoria de Conformidade Global — GymSite
%% Ver .agent/rules/auditoria-conformidade.md
%% SailPoint-inspired: snapshot ≠ monitoring
%% Abrir → Ctrl+Shift+P → MermaidChart: Preview Diagram

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scoped

    state "SLA: 1d — domínio + critério + amostra\nFontes|Tools|Número|Schema|Deploy|Segurança" as Scoped
    Scoped --> Evidence: collect (Author)

    state "SLA: 2d — ledger / diff / UUID / SPEC" as Evidence
    Evidence --> Findings: analyze (Author→Reviewer)

    state "SLA: 2d — gaps Crítico|Alto|Médio|Baixo\n⚠️ Approver se >2d" as Findings
    Findings --> Corrective: approve findings (Approver)
    Findings --> Closed: defer / accept risk (Approver)
    Findings --> Evidence: request more evidence (Reviewer)

    state "Act-on / ticket\nSe gap Tool → auditoria-tools Draft→Approved" as Corrective
    Corrective --> Retest: fix shipped

    state "SLA: 1d — prova que gap fechou" as Retest
    Retest --> Closed: pass
    Retest --> Corrective: fail → rework

    state "relatório 1p + links\n✅ Notify Author" as Closed
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Corrective
      Ponte: auditoria-tools.md
      (5 Whys + mmd + Act-on)
    end note